,"source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001818643"},{"text":"Gross margin expanded from 76.6% to 81.2% against the same quarter a year earlier - the company is keeping more of what it sells, not buying growth with discounts.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001818643"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $133.2m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1818643/000119312526221647/0001193125-26-221647-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-221647"}],"bear":[{"text":"Growth is erratic - a standard deviation of 41.9% across 4 comparisons. Lumpy revenue usually means few customers or long contracts, and both make any single quarter a poor guide.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1818643/000119312526221647/0001193125-26-221647-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-221647"},{"text":"Shareholders' equity is negative (-$63.6m) - liabilities exceed assets on the balance sheet.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1818643/000119312526221647/0001193125-26-221647-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-221647"},{"text":"Only 7 quarters of reported history. There is no track record here to speak of, and a short series flatters whatever the recent trend happens to be.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001818643"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 12.2% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (2,500 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1818643/000119312526245570/0001193125-26-245570-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes 